  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO support to Fellowship Scheme 2022 to 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide junior economists &amp; statisticians to work in developing country Governments and organisations. Every economist, statistician is placed in a developing country Government, organisation Department for 2 years to provide technical economic statistical support and advice for improved policy making and value for money economy, efficiency, cost-effectiveness and effectiveness of service delivery and systems.</narrative>
  </description>
